WEBVTT

1
00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:49.833
After granting Arjun the divine eyes,

2
00:01:49.833 --> 00:01:54.125
Lord Krishna now reveals His Viraat Vishwarupa.

3
00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:57.708
This is a momentous moment
in the Bhagavad Gita.

4
00:01:57.708 --> 00:01:58.916
Until now, Lord Krishna

5
00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:02.250
had only spoken of His greatness,

6
00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:06.000
but now He is actually showing it.

7
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.708
Sanjaya, who has already been

8
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:09.583
granted divine sight,

9
00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:13.291
describes this scene to King Dhritarashtra.

10
00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:21.208
Sanjaya begins describing the divine vision

11
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.958
to Dhritarashtra, saying

12
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:25.625
that Yogeshvara Lord Krishna,

13
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:29.250
the master of all mystical powers,

14
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.750
has now revealed His Viraat

15
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.750
Vishwarupa to Arjun.

16
00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.000
This is not a dream or illusion.

17
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.583
It is a real

18
00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:39.500
and divine revelation,

19
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.583
which can only be seen

20
00:02:41.583 --> 00:02:44.708
through the special sight
granted by Lord Krishna Himself.

21
00:02:44.708 --> 00:02:47.000
What does Arjun see?

22
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.000
He sees a vast, all-pervading form,

23
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.750
with countless faces, eyes,

24
00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.666
hands, and divine weapons.

25
00:02:56.666 --> 00:03:00.083
It is adorned with heavenly ornaments,

26
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:02.166
fragrant with celestial scents,

27
00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:04.208
and dressed in divine robes.

28
00:03:04.208 --> 00:03:07.750
In this wondrous form,
everything is magnificent, radiant,

29
00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.541
and far beyond human imagination.

30
00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:12.000
To help Dhritarashtra

31
00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.500
understand,

32
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.166
Sanjaya compares the radiance of this form

33
00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:18.541
to thousands of suns

34
00:03:18.541 --> 00:03:20.458
rising simultaneously.

35
00:03:20.458 --> 00:03:22.625
Even this comparison is not enough,

36
00:03:22.625 --> 00:03:25.375
because the brilliance of the Vishwarupa is such

37
00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:28.833
that no human eye could ever perceive it.

38
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.708
Arjun also sees this incredible sight –

39
00:03:31.708 --> 00:03:35.541
that the entire universe is
within Lord Krishna's body.

40
00:03:35.541 --> 00:03:37.583
He sees different planets, stars,

41
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:40.083
and cosmic forces.

42
00:03:40.083 --> 00:03:42.875
All are present within this one form.

43
00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:45.541
Ordinarily, no one, sitting in one place,

44
00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:48.750
can see the entire universe.

45
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.125
But Lord Krishna's divine sight

46
00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:52.500
enables Arjun to see everything

47
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.916
at once.

48
00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:57.000
This experience

49
00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.333
completely transforms

50
00:03:58.333 --> 00:04:00.666
Arjun's emotions.

51
00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:03.291
Until now, he had seen
Lord Krishna as his closest

52
00:04:03.291 --> 00:04:06.500
friend and charioteer,

53
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.708
but

54
00:04:07.708 --> 00:04:10.875
now he sees Him as the Supreme Lord.

55
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:14.125
As the controller of all things,

56
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:15.916
his body trembles,

57
00:04:15.916 --> 00:04:17.875
his hair stands on end,

58
00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:20.333
and with deep reverence

59
00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:25.583
he bows and joins his hands in prayer.

60
00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:28.000
This moment in the Gita proves

61
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.375
that Lord Krishna is, beyond doubt,
the Supreme Lord.

62
00:04:31.375 --> 00:04:34.208
By revealing this Vishwarupa, He confirms

63
00:04:34.208 --> 00:04:37.125
that He is the cause of all, not merely

64
00:04:37.125 --> 00:04:41.000
a great teacher or warrior.

65
00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.791
For future generations,

66
00:04:42.791 --> 00:04:46.041
this vision will always serve as a reminder.

67
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:48.791
Lord Krishna is the supreme truth.

68
00:04:48.791 --> 00:04:54.000
He who holds the entire universe within Himself.

69
00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.791
Overwhelmed by what he sees,

70
00:04:57.791 --> 00:05:01.125
Arjun now prepares to pray,

71
00:05:01.125 --> 00:05:05.458
having understood the true
greatness of Lord Krishna.

72
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.500
What happens

73
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.708
when, different from the outcome you imagined,

74
00:05:16.708 --> 00:05:21.708
something incredible occurs?

75
00:05:21.708 --> 00:05:23.875
Then listen,

76
00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:25.708
what happened when

77
00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:28.166
Arjun beheld My

78
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:32.000
Viraat Vishwarupa.

79
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.208
Seeing it, Arjun

80
00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:36.833
was left speechless.

81
00:05:36.833 --> 00:05:39.083
Yet

82
00:05:39.083 --> 00:05:41.416
he joined his hands,

83
00:05:41.416 --> 00:05:43.375
he prayed.

84
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:44.541
He did not react

85
00:05:44.541 --> 00:05:49.416
with fear, confusion, or arrogance.

86
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:54.125
Instead, he bowed with gratitude

87
00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:57.333
and devotion.

88
00:05:57.333 --> 00:05:59.458
This is a lesson

89
00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:02.333
for your life.

90
00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.708
When you pray

91
00:06:04.708 --> 00:06:08.250
or wish for something,

92
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:14.041
you usually have a certain expectation

93
00:06:14.041 --> 00:06:18.416
of how things should unfold.

94
00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:23.250
But in life it does not always happen

95
00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:26.125
as you expect.

96
00:06:26.125 --> 00:06:29.625
Even after you work very hard,

97
00:06:29.625 --> 00:06:31.791
you do not get a promotion.

98
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:34.750
Even after making an excellent product,

99
00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.833
the business remains slow.

100
00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:40.166
In such times, do not be disheartened.

101
00:06:40.166 --> 00:06:43.500
Understand that every failure

102
00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.125
signals that there is still

103
00:06:47.125 --> 00:06:48.583
room for improvement.

104
00:06:48.583 --> 00:06:50.291
Regroup,

105
00:06:50.291 --> 00:06:54.500
find the gaps, and success will surely come.

106
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.750
On the other hand,

107
00:06:56.750 --> 00:07:00.291
if the business flourishes greatly,

108
00:07:00.291 --> 00:07:02.708
do not become complacent.

109
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:03.708
Be grateful for this

110
00:07:03.708 --> 00:07:07.458
success and work even harder,

111
00:07:07.458 --> 00:07:10.791
so that this success becomes lasting.

112
00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:13.875
Sometimes blessings and grace

113
00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:16.708
arrive in ways

114
00:07:16.708 --> 00:07:20.208
you never imagined,

115
00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:24.375
and sometimes challenges come

116
00:07:24.375 --> 00:07:27.375
when you least

117
00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:29.125
expected them.

118
00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:31.166
In both situations,

119
00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:34.708
remember Arjun's response.

120
00:07:34.708 --> 00:07:39.041
Join your hands, bow your head,

121
00:07:39.041 --> 00:07:40.750
and what comes,

122
00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.791
accept it with humility.

123
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:45.833
Trust

124
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:48.625
that, beyond what you can see,

125
00:07:48.625 --> 00:07:52.666
there is a far greater plan.

126
00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:54.875
When life surprises you

127
00:07:54.875 --> 00:07:58.083
with more than you hoped,

128
00:07:58.083 --> 00:08:00.458
offer gratitude,

129
00:08:00.458 --> 00:08:02.666
and when challenges arise,

130
00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:05.208
offer prayer.

131
00:08:05.208 --> 00:08:09.250
This perspective keeps you steady in both success

132
00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.750
and difficulty.

133
00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:18.250
It helps you move forward
with strength and peace.

134
00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:21.625
Whether obstacle or success,

135
00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:25.166
keep gratitude always.

136
00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:33.833
When Arjun beheld My Vishwarupa,

137
00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:39.500
it was far beyond his expectation.

138
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:44.000
Yet his response was

139
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.000
to humbly join his hands

140
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.958
and pray.

141
00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:54.250
This is a lesson for families too.

142
00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.000
In life,

143
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.083
for your family

144
00:08:58.083 --> 00:09:02.041
you may have hopes and expectations.

145
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:05.083
Plans for your children,

146
00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:07.916
dreams for your relatives,

147
00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:11.500
or wishes for stability and happiness.

148
00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.916
But sometimes life

149
00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:17.250
unfolds differently.

150
00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.041
Challenges may come, or blessings –

151
00:09:20.041 --> 00:09:23.166
blessings too may arrive in ways

152
00:09:23.166 --> 00:09:26.458
you never anticipated.

153
00:09:26.458 --> 00:09:29.666
A long illness of a family member,

154
00:09:29.666 --> 00:09:34.500
or a member losing their job for some reason,

155
00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.208
creates before the family

156
00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:41.333
both emotional and financial strain.

157
00:09:41.333 --> 00:09:42.625
In such times, if all members

158
00:09:42.625 --> 00:09:45.500
stand united and walk together,

159
00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:48.333
then even this difficult time passes.

160
00:09:48.333 --> 00:09:52.500
When things turn out differently
from your expectations,

161
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.583
whether good or difficult,

162
00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:59.916
then respond just like Arjun.

163
00:09:59.916 --> 00:10:02.333
Accept the situation with humility

164
00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:05.666
and gratitude.

165
00:10:05.666 --> 00:10:10.041
If unexpected joys arrive,

166
00:10:10.041 --> 00:10:14.875
be grateful together as a family.

167
00:10:14.875 --> 00:10:18.625
If challenges appear, then with faith

168
00:10:18.625 --> 00:10:23.208
and patience, support each other.

169
00:10:23.208 --> 00:10:28.291
Trust that there is a higher plan,

170
00:10:28.291 --> 00:10:31.833
which you cannot fully see.

171
00:10:31.833 --> 00:10:34.750
Teach your family

172
00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:38.583
that whatever circumstances life brings,

173
00:10:38.583 --> 00:10:42.750
bow your head in gratitude

174
00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:46.166
and seek My guidance.

175
00:10:46.166 --> 00:10:49.166
You will keep receiving the wisdom and strength

176
00:10:49.166 --> 00:10:53.250
to grow with love and unity.

177
00:10:58.083 --> 00:11:00.416
How does it feel

178
00:11:00.416 --> 00:11:03.166
when you receive the award for best employee

179
00:11:03.166 --> 00:11:04.166
or best

180
00:11:04.166 --> 00:11:07.541
businessperson?

181
00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:09.500
Do you become grateful,

182
00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.750
or does pride make you

183
00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.125
boastful?

184
00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:14.375
Hear the truth,

185
00:11:14.375 --> 00:11:17.708
when Arjun beheld My Vishwarupa,

186
00:11:17.708 --> 00:11:21.041
it was far beyond his expectation.

187
00:11:21.041 --> 00:11:23.458
Yet

188
00:11:23.458 --> 00:11:25.958
he responded with humility,

189
00:11:25.958 --> 00:11:29.541
joined his hands, and offered respect.

190
00:11:29.541 --> 00:11:31.583
This is a powerful lesson

191
00:11:31.583 --> 00:11:34.875
for your professional life too.

192
00:11:34.875 --> 00:11:38.083
You often set goals,

193
00:11:38.083 --> 00:11:39.500
make plans,

194
00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.708
and work hard.

195
00:11:41.708 --> 00:11:45.500
You expect certain outcomes,

196
00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:48.416
but success and challenges

197
00:11:48.416 --> 00:11:50.750
can also come in ways

198
00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.208
you never anticipated.

199
00:11:54.208 --> 00:11:58.500
Sometimes greater than you
imagined, and sometimes

200
00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:01.916
harder than you expected.

201
00:12:01.916 --> 00:12:06.083
When success comes unexpectedly,

202
00:12:06.083 --> 00:12:09.000
respond like Arjun.

203
00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.500
With humility

204
00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.416
and gratitude,

205
00:12:12.416 --> 00:12:13.916
do not let ego

206
00:12:13.916 --> 00:12:17.000
take over your judgement.

207
00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.625
Recognise that your achievements

208
00:12:20.625 --> 00:12:23.750
are only a small part

209
00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:27.458
of a larger picture.

210
00:12:27.458 --> 00:12:30.208
In the same way, when challenges

211
00:12:30.208 --> 00:12:32.541
arrive unexpectedly,

212
00:12:32.541 --> 00:12:34.000
do not be disheartened.

213
00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.958
Accept them as opportunities for growth.

214
00:12:37.958 --> 00:12:42.166
Trust that they have a purpose,

215
00:12:42.166 --> 00:12:46.583
which you have not yet understood.

216
00:12:46.583 --> 00:12:52.375
See both success and failure
with the same mindset.

217
00:12:52.375 --> 00:12:54.750
Join your hands in humility.

218
00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:58.166
Remain steady, but keep moving forward.

219
00:12:58.166 --> 00:13:01.041
This perspective will earn you respect.

220
00:13:01.041 --> 00:13:04.500
It will build strong relationships
and, with confidence

221
00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:09.791
and dignity, help you advance
in your job or business.
